# Quick Reference Guide

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# Setup
pnpm i && pnpm build

# Development
pnpm dev

# Test an example
pnpm shuvi dev examples/basic
```

## 📁 Key Directories

| Directory | Purpose | Key Files |
|-----------|---------|-----------|
| [packages/shuvi/](mdc:packages/shuvi) | Main CLI & Framework | [bin/cli.js](mdc:packages/shuvi/bin/cli.js) |
| [packages/runtime/](mdc:packages/runtime) | Core Runtime | Core application runtime |
| [packages/compiler/](mdc:packages/compiler) | Build System | Webpack/Babel configs |
| [packages/router/](mdc:packages/router) | Routing | Framework-agnostic router |
| [test/](mdc:test) | E2E Tests | Integration tests |
| [examples/](mdc:examples) | Examples | Sample applications |

## ⚡ Essential Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `pnpm dev` | Start development mode |
| `pnpm build` | Build all packages |
| `pnpm test` | Run all tests |
| `pnpm shuvi` | Run CLI directly |
| `pnpm clean` | Clean build artifacts |

## 🔧 Configuration Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [package.json](mdc:package.json) | Root package config |
| [turbo.json](mdc:turbo.json) | Turborepo build config |
| [jest.config.js](mdc:jest.config.js) | Testing configuration |
| [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) | TypeScript config |
| [pnpm-workspace.yaml](mdc:pnpm-workspace.yaml) | Workspace definition |

## 🧪 Testing Quick Reference

```bash
# Unit tests
pnpm test:unit

# E2E tests  
pnpm test:e2e

# Specific server tests
pnpm test:e2e:express
pnpm test:e2e:koa
```

## 📋 Development Checklist

- [ ] Install dependencies: `pnpm i`
- [ ] Build packages: `pnpm build`  
- [ ] Run tests: `pnpm test`
- [ ] Check code style: automatic via lint-staged
- [ ] Create changeset: `pnpm changeset` (if needed)

